I'm supposed to get an urgent punishment order.

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:24.220
I'm sorry for the wound.

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:25.720
What?

00:18:28.530 --> 00:18:28.630
What?

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:29.970
Koshi is...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:30.500
Did you wake up?

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:34.680
If you make one mistake, someone else is in danger.

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:36.520
I'm sorry.

00:18:37.690 --> 00:18:39.730
What happened? You don't look like yourself.

00:18:40.070 --> 00:18:41.600
I was just in a bad mood.

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:44.300
I'll excuse myself for today.

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:46.430
Yuta...

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:51.610
Kiba! What's wrong with you?

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:52.730
You're really weird.

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:54.720
How could you treat the chief like that?

00:18:55.260 --> 00:18:57.130
It has nothing to do with you.

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:58.580
You're worried, aren't you?

00:18:58.840 --> 00:18:59.760
Worried?

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:01.130
Who's asking who?

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:01.810
Huh?

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:04.880
The devil is supposed to be selfish.

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:06.980
What are you saying?

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:10.660
Well, I think I was wrong today.

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:11.730
See you.

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:12.340
Wait!

00:19:12.760 --> 00:19:15.610
If you have any problems, let me know!

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:17.740
We're friends, aren't we?

00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:18.550
Friends?

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:21.800
Issei-kun, you're hot.

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:25.460
I remembered the basics.

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:28.040
The basics?

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:29.600
The meaning of life.

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:34.390
In other words, what am I fighting for?

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:37.120
Isn't this for the chief?

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:40.690
No. I am living for revenge.

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:42.900
Revenge?

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:45.040
Seiken Excalibur.

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:48.760
Destroying it is the meaning of my life.

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:55.860
Seiken is the worst weapon for the devil.

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:59.140
The devil will only look at you if you touch it.

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:02.540
If it's cut, it can be immediately destroyed.

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:06.660
The Holy Sword can destroy demons.

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:09.240
It's a terrifying weapon.

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:13.370
However, it is extremely limited in what it can handle.

00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:14.680
That's the biggest problem.

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:20.310
That's why the Church decided to try to artificially cultivate something that can handle the Holy Sword, the Excalibur.

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:26.450
That is the Holy Sword Plan.

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:27.950
The Holy Sword Plan?

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:29.450
I'm in the Church!

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:32.430
I've never heard anything like that before.

00:20:32.630 --> 00:20:33.670
I guess so.

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:35.590
It's a long time ago.

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:38.280
I heard that the plan was a complete failure.

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:39.440
What?

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:44.980
Yuta is still alive.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:47.470
Kiba-san is...

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:51.920
Wait a minute.

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:58.380
Kiba saw this photo and said it was a holy sword.

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:06.860
It's not as powerful as the Excalibur, but there's no mistaking it. This is the Holy Sword.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:11.260
It's true. Ever since I saw this, he's been acting weird.

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:12.910
That...

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:13.830
I didn't know he was in Namijika.

00:21:14.570 --> 00:21:21.220
I remember! I've been invited by this girl's family to go to the church a few times.

00:21:21.860 --> 00:21:23.620
That's right.

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:28.680
I know that all the people here have disappeared, but I'm sure...

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:31.130
Chief?

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:33.460
Oh, I'm sorry. It's already this late.

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:35.330
Come on, let's go to bed.

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:38.600
Chief, why are you wearing clothes here?

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:42.670
Why? You know that I can't sleep if I'm naked, right?

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:46.300
No, no, no, no. Why are you in my room?

00:21:46.520 --> 00:21:48.590
Because I'm going to sleep with you.

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:50.190
What?

00:21:50.690 --> 00:21:52.730
What are you talking about?

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:59.440
This is what I'm going to do tonight.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:04.420
Eh, ma'am.

00:22:04.540 --> 00:22:11.980
What I would tell lovely group

00:22:11.980 --> 00:22:13.320
You have a double kindness

00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:20.150
It is no time to talk

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:23.340
Then is SEI-san please be decided

00:22:23.340 --> 00:22:24.520
I understand

00:22:24.520 --> 00:22:25.480
Will you?

00:22:25.480 --> 00:22:26.340
SEI Mr., please

00:22:26.340 --> 00:22:27.360
What?!

00:22:27.940 --> 00:22:29.420
No. It will not be decided

00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:32.960
You were cute enough to fall down.

00:22:32.960 --> 00:22:38.510
I'm sorry, I'll give it to you in five minutes.

00:22:38.510 --> 00:22:45.420
Miss... Miss.... Miss... Miss.... Miss... Miss.... Miss... Miss.... Mississsssssssss

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:32.440
I heard that the devil caused a human riot, but...

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:34.040
But it's late.

00:23:34.320 --> 00:23:38.640
Is the meeting place really okay here?

00:23:39.330 --> 00:23:40.250
There's no mistaking it.

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:42.690
This is where I spent time with my parents.

00:23:43.710 --> 00:23:45.260
Since I was a child.

00:23:45.580 --> 00:23:56.820
We're friends!

00:23:57.160 --> 00:23:59.800
I'm sorry. I...

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:04.480
You're supposed to have fun with your friends, but you don't have the right to do that.

00:24:05.840 --> 00:24:06.400
Run!

00:24:11.800 --> 00:24:13.420
Yo, yo!

00:24:13.780 --> 00:24:14.340
Yahoo!

00:24:14.960 --> 00:24:16.040
Oh, there you are!

00:24:16.460 --> 00:24:18.020
If you're wondering who I am...

00:24:18.020 --> 00:24:20.440
Aren't you the fucking bad-ass man from Totsu Akuma?

00:24:22.180 --> 00:24:24.320
Plead Seizen!

00:24:24.500 --> 00:24:26.930
So you're still lurking around this town?

00:24:27.420 --> 00:24:28.720
What a wonderful reunion!

00:24:29.120 --> 00:24:29.840
I'll...

00:24:30.160 --> 00:24:30.800
You're so strong!

00:24:31.380 --> 00:24:35.410
Unfortunately, I'm not in a good mood today.

00:24:37.030 --> 00:24:38.090
That's a good thing!

00:24:38.930 --> 00:24:41.570
I was just tired of being a bridegroom.

00:24:42.590 --> 00:24:44.230
That shine!

00:24:44.930 --> 00:24:46.380
Oh, no way!

00:24:46.480 --> 00:24:47.310
Chiku!

00:24:47.810 --> 00:24:48.750
Nice timing!

00:24:49.110 --> 00:24:50.280
I wonder if you can let me try it with the previous return.

00:24:52.800 --> 00:24:53.940
Which one is stronger?

00:24:54.400 --> 00:24:57.480
Your fucking sword or this holy sword?

00:24:57.860 --> 00:24:59.120
Excalibur!

00:25:05.630 --> 00:25:06.280
I won't forgive you, Equaliver.

00:25:36.490 --> 00:25:38.000
Thank you for watching!

00:26:39.950 --> 00:26:42.690
A beautiful girl?!

00:26:42.690 --> 00:26:44.180
But what she's holding is...

00:26:45.000 --> 00:26:46.900
Seiken! Are you guys my enemies?

00:26:47.260 --> 00:26:50.210
Next time, Seiken Kimaster!
